## Bun workspace commands

Run workspace commands from the repository root:

```bash
bun install
bun install --frozen-lockfile
bun run --workspaces --if-present build
bun run --workspaces --if-present typecheck
bun run --cwd {{frontend.root}} <script>
bun run --cwd {{backend.root}} <script>
```

Use package-local scripts as the behavior boundary. Root scripts delegate
through Bun workspaces and do not encode framework, release, or delivery
commands.
